  <item>
    <title>150. 爱情36问#9 为什么束手无策啊我和你的爱情</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6922fa616018cc2c98319550</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6922fa616018cc2c98319550</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Nov 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见~&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>原计划聊聊这一季的「再见爱人」，无奈大毛的观看进度太慢，只能往后顺延几期，但小宝还是找到了非常好的几个问题来问问我这个后进生。这期节目原来的标题是「爱情是玄学」，在整理这期节目shownotes的时候刚好听到了「超人」，那就借用这句歌词来描述面对亲密关系的束手无策吧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>❤️ 往期节目</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>#1 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62dc19cd92f0689a31f505b1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62dc19cd92f0689a31f505b1"><span>想念的心装满的都是你</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>#2 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62e4024888a3150c3ae351a0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62e4024888a3150c3ae351a0"><span>拥有你就不需要魔法给的勇气</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>#3 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6381b537f6753f4e9d4d580d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6381b537f6753f4e9d4d580d"><span>你是我最重要的决定</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>#4 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6680bd31cdd230b23b2206fc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6680bd31cdd230b23b2206fc"><span>如何拉近这一段芬兰距离</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>#5 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66afa19a33ddcbb53c400c21" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66afa19a33ddcbb53c400c21"><span>没关系 我们都会犯错误</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>#6 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67285608cbe0e69c8bef27e2" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67285608cbe0e69c8bef27e2"><span>爱情的朝九晚五</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>#7 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e970d88eecdbeb601e2979" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e970d88eecdbeb601e2979"><span>那年的偏执不是幼稚</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>#8 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fe7d7c0156720321241b39" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fe7d7c0156720321241b39"><span>下一次会更勇敢</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>⏳ 声音目录</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">00:01:15</a> 超级奶爸和超级妈妈：大家都是第一次啦</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">00:06:25</a> 这里才是节目的开头</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">00:13:02</a> 当你的伴侣要和你好好聊聊把话说开</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">00:32:02</a> 在让步里完成亲密关系的晋级</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2353">00:39:13</a> 争吵未尝不是一种沟通方式</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3635">01:00:35</a> 你的伴侣还能给你充上电吗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4896">01:21:36</a> 不知道我的老哥哥在亲密关系里会不会也遇到这样的问题</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5020">01:23:40</a> 在亲密关系里继续做自己</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 音乐合集</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在网易云音乐搜索“</span><a href="http://music.163.com/playlist?id=7329655280&amp;userid=254931863" data-url="http://music.163.com/playlist?id=7329655280&amp;userid=254931863"><strong><span>双城FM播客歌单</span></strong></a><span>”，可以获得每期节目的音乐合集</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Weeknd，Playboi Carti，Madonna，</span><em><span>Popular</span></em><span>，2023年6月作品</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>江美琪，郑兴，《走到哪都下着雨》，2024年10月作品</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>曾沛慈，《数到十》，2025年5月作品</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Melody殷悦，《爱多少早知道》，2003年6月作品</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>📮 欢迎报名参加节目的录制，也欢迎来信咨询/讨论你感兴趣的话题，获取更多信息请邮件联系</span><strong><span>socpek@yeah.net</span></strong></p>]]></description>
